      "side": 1,
      "message": "Technically not necessary because if we ever rerun bp2build we regenerate the whole symlink tree. However I imagine in the future there could be a scenario where we rerun bp2build, which only updates generated files, and doesn\u0027t regenerate the symlink tree because that generated file was simply symlinked into the tree.",
      "parentUuid": "6467037b_f27744c1",
      "revId": "1131d95d7d1a2313799bb38d3dcbe479b2fc768b",
