      "writtenOn": "2022-10-07T19:56:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am hesitant to remove it because we could miss it when doing that separation later. And a always-rerunning bp2build is much easier to spot than a sometimes-not-rerunning bp2build. So I\u0027d like to keep it, but if you still feel strongly about removing it let me know and I\u0027ll do it.",
      "parentUuid": "fc87704b_5589a14a",
